<title>FINLAND: Nokia wins U.K. switching systems order.</title>
<headline>Nokia wins U.K. switching systems order.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecoms group Nokia Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it had won a deal to deliver switching systems to British Redstone Network Services Ltd.</p>
<p>The agreement included two digital multi-purpose telephone exchanges and a comprehensive five-year maintenance support framework for Redstone's network, Nokia said. It did not specify the value of the order.</p>
</text>
